{"id":68345,"date":"2025-09-17T07:28:15","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T06:28:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68345"},"modified":"2026-10-23T11:57:06","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T10:57:06","slug":"trail-mortagua","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-mortagua\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Mort\u00e1gua 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Mort\u00e1gua 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Mort\u00e1gua 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>1 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), levando os amantes da corrida de natureza a descobrir os trilhos florestais e rurais do concelho de <strong>Mort\u00e1gua<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada instaladas junto \u00e0 <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Mort\u00e1gua<\/strong>, o evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> para as dist\u00e2ncias competitivas de trail e \u00e0s <strong>09:05<\/strong> para a caminhada.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Inserido na paisagem verdejante da regi\u00e3o entre as serras do Caramulo e do Bu\u00e7aco e a bacia do rio Mondego, o evento disponibiliza tr\u00eas percursos circulares adaptados a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: o <strong>Trail Longo de 22 km<\/strong> (tempo limite de 4 horas), o <strong>Trail Curto de 14 km<\/strong> (limite de 3 horas) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong>. Os trilhos percorrem caminhos rurais e florestais da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Mort\u00e1gua, Vale de Rem\u00edgio, Cortega\u00e7a e Alma\u00e7a, contando com tr\u00eas postos de abastecimento estrat\u00e9gicos em <strong>Cortega\u00e7a<\/strong>, <strong>Marmeleira<\/strong> e <strong>Carapinhal (Lavadouro)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Promovido e organizado pelo <strong>N\u00facleo do Sporting Clube de Portugal de Mort\u00e1gua<\/strong>, o evento alia a competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva a uma forte vertente comunit\u00e1ria e solid\u00e1ria, revertendo parte do valor das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es da caminhada a favor da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Mort\u00e1gua<\/strong>. Todos os participantes usufruem de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos e banhos, com medalha <em>finisher<\/em> garantida para os atletas que concluam as provas de trail e trof\u00e9us para os cinco primeiros da geral e tr\u00eas primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o e equipas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Mort\u00e1gua, Viseu<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\